","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124524","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124524.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124524.patch","merged_at":"2026-10-19T20:57:31Z"},"body":"* Closes #123102 \r\n---\r\nDue to the editor dimming some icons when in a light theme, the unchecked checkboxes in the 3D editor viewport end up almost invisible against the dark panels. To fix this, I added a theme type variation that sets the icon's color to an overblown white.\r\n\r\n|  | Before | After |\r\n|--------|--------|--------|\r\n| Default | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"default-bef\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c76d2b00-8f7e-4dcf-a7d9-5a206ee66cad\" /> | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"default-af\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03ef3745-14e2-4e9e-a57b-27333dd54ae1\" /> |\r\n| OLED | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"oled-bef\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/773e9c39-7838-49da-8946-83aef1a42a42\" /> | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"oled-af\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf859c45-17a4-4f93-8741-7a675b2af2a3\" /> |\r\n| Light | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"light-bef\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/56f75831-5738-4bfd-9eb4-dffaa0a002b8\" /> | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"light-af\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ddf3ce23-8fb1-41c0-b1e3-da604cc7f528\" /> |\r\n| Solarized<br>Light | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"solar-bef\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d2218b38-9e20-4afc-b611-06d98b62d91f\" /> | <img width=\"124\" height=\"38\" alt=\"solar-af\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3e17c1f-71c0-408f-87a1-ebfa2c36052e\" /> |\r\n\r\nAlso, left a comment there 'cause the `Color(3, 3, 3)` is probably a bit odd on its own.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://